{"data": [{"author_id": "1250902489", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:02:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117422034435403995"], "id": "2117422034435403995", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117220878157283721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 要发邮件申请合并，不过真的太慢了，合并了快7个工作日才完成，中间完全无法登陆gork bot,合并了之后把我两个grok bot账号也合并了，结果其中一个失效了，包括这个账号申请下来的grokbot邮箱。", "url": "https://x.com/Neltharion_/status/2117422034435403995"}, {"author_id": "1992461", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:02:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117422021898563890"], "id": "2117422021898563890", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117220878157283721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 登录链路绕三圈只是表象，根因是 OAuth 授权和订阅计费系统没打通——身份验证过了，但 entitlement 没同步。合并期这种跨系统状态不一致会持续一阵，建议先确认 cursor 侧是否已接入 x 的订阅校验接口。", "url": "https://x.com/fishjar/status/2117422021898563890"}, {"author_id": "2067993269309452288", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:53:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117419811982475450"], "id": "2117419811982475450", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117220878157283721", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 从 cursor 跳 grok 再跳 X，绕一圈回来，确实折腾 😓 ，好在就一次", "url": "https://x.com/JingW59/status/2117419811982475450"}, {"author_id": "1432872224378085383", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:53:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117419754650759587"], "id": "2117419754650759587", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "